    "description": {
      "value": "Opening this vial releases a mighty gust, forming into a fearsome Huge elemental hurricane. The elemental breathes a 30-foot cone of air. Each creature in the cone must succeed at a DC 28 Fortitude save or be knocked away from the elemental.\n\nA creature knocked into a solid object stops moving and takes 4d6 bludgeoning damage.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature is pushed 10 feet.\n- **Failure:** The creature is pushed 20 feet.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature is pushed 20 feet and knocked prone.\n\nActivate (2 Actions); Components Interact"
